T193 - fresh production attribution and uniform removal ceilings
Branch experiment/cloud-descriptor-k, base 45801cd (T192). Not merged.
Ultra, raw scale 0.2500, cloud target 480x270, framebuffer 1920x1080,
96 steps, 60 samples per cell, three anchor-bracketed blocks per arm per pose.
No new shader variants: both ceilings already existed as T176's no-light arm
and T180's no-probe arm.

This attribution is production-path because no rain-field campaign is armed,
so the monolith is not forced to build a field. Every T192 capture ran with
that force on, which is why none of them could select the next target.

